### GET all petients
GET localhost:4444/patients
###

### POST one patient
POST localhost:4444/patients
Content-Type: application/json


{
  "name": "John Doe Kafka Test",
  "email": "kafka_test11@example.com",
  "address": "123 main street22",
  "birthDate": "1995-09-09"
}
