### Updating existing Petient
PUT localhost:4444/patients/123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe UPDATED 2",
  "email": "kafka_test11@exampleffff.com",
  "address": "123 main street",
  "birthDate": "1995-09-09"
}
###

### Delete existing Petient
DELETE localhost:4444/patients/123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000

